%%{init: {'theme':'base','fontFamily':'arial, sans-serif','themeVariables':{'primaryColor':'#ECFDF5','primaryTextColor':'#064E3B','primaryBorderColor':'#10B981','lineColor':'#059669','fontFamily':'arial, sans-serif','fontSize':'16px'}}}%%
flowchart TB
  accTitle: 3C quality gates, grouped by when they fire and by who enforces them
  accDescr: While editing, the path guard hook blocks and the post-edit boundary check hook advises without blocking. While writing, the skill redacts secrets from the plan and the CLI refuses a test file, PR body or handover that carries one, and the skill writes a failing test before the code. At commit, the commit gate hook blocks by default; 3c bypass skips one commit with a reason and is logged. Before the PR, the skill stops on critical or major /3c-review findings, on a failing verify gate, and on a blocking review board verdict after one fix cycle. At ship, the skill asks a person to confirm the branch and the PR and never merges on its own.

  subgraph EDIT["While editing"]
    direction LR
    PG["<b>Path guard</b><br/>inside an agent: Read, Grep and Glob only;<br/>no .env, ~/.ssh or ~/.aws reads<br/><i>hook · blocks</i>"]
    PE["<b>Post-edit boundary check</b><br/>imports against architecture.yaml<br/><i>hook · advisory, never blocks the edit</i>"]
  end

  subgraph WRITE["While writing"]
    direction LR
    SS["<b>Secret scan</b><br/>plan · test file · PR body · handover<br/><i>skill redacts the plan · CLI refuses a test file, PR body or handover</i>"]
    RG["<b>RED before GREEN</b><br/>a failing test before the code<br/><i>skill rule · the skill stops</i>"]
  end

  subgraph COMMIT["At commit"]
    direction LR
    CG["<b>Commit gate</b><br/>the team's .3c/hooks.yaml chain<br/><i>hook · blocks by default</i>"]
    BY["<b>3c bypass</b><br/>one commit, with a reason, logged<br/><i>a person's choice · the skills are barred from it</i>"]
  end

  subgraph PRE["Before the PR"]
    direction LR
    RV["<b>/3c-review</b><br/>critical or major findings<br/><i>skill rule · an override opens a draft</i>"]
    VG["<b>Verify gate</b><br/>build and full check, output quoted<br/><i>skill rule · stops on a non-zero exit</i>"]
    RB["<b>Review board</b><br/>the 3c reconcile verdict<br/><i>skill rule · blocking gets one fix cycle</i>"]
    PERSON["Back to a person"]
    RB -->|still blocking| PERSON
  end

  subgraph SHIP["At ship"]
    direction LR
    HU["<b>A person confirms</b><br/>the branch and the PR<br/><i>skill rule · no auto-merge, no force-push</i>"]
  end

  EDIT --> WRITE --> COMMIT --> PRE --> SHIP
  CG -.- BY
  PG ~~~ PE
  SS ~~~ RG
  RV ~~~ VG ~~~ RB

  classDef enforced fill:#ECFDF5,stroke:#047857,color:#064E3B,stroke-width:2px
  classDef rule fill:#EEF2FF,stroke:#4F46E5,color:#1E1B4B,stroke-width:1.5px
  classDef advisory fill:#FEF3C7,stroke:#D97706,color:#78350F,stroke-width:1.5px
  classDef human fill:#047857,stroke:#064E3B,color:#fff,stroke-width:2px
  classDef stop fill:#FEE2E2,stroke:#DC2626,color:#7F1D1D,stroke-width:1.5px
  class PG,SS,CG enforced
  class RG,RV,VG,RB rule
  class PE,BY advisory
  class HU human
  class PERSON stop
